<section image-layout="blank" id="xMdwlYaDbP"><grid spacing="medium"><grid-item id="8H1rDq98mq" vertical-align="end" padding="18pt 18pt 60pt" colspan="22"><img src="https://cdn-staging.gamma.app/QWjS6fBfpt/generated-images/FkgXYT8UJUI9N3ZoID4Q9.png" saved-media-id="wsi7wj2v1atjszo" source="image.ai-generated" background="true" image-style="southern-brazil-paper-museum" alt="Layered cut-paper museum-table illustration of an opened folded map reconnected to a tax paper, a tied letter and a food basket by one winding postcard-red paper thread, warm cream ground, river-blue geography marks and sun-yellow discovery tabs, clear daylight, no people, no flags, no weapons, no readable text" meta="{&quot;width&quot;:1248,&quot;height&quot;:1664}"><grid spacing="none" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item id="FQfpf2qsQv" background-color="accent" padding="12pt 16pt"><p role="eyebrow">Illustrated reconstruction</p><h3>The clues reconnect</h3></grid-item></grid></grid-item><grid-item id="ZpCDqdc9Ob" colspan="38"><h2>1845 changed one thing—not everything</h2><table col-widths="[17,43]" header-col="true" borders="none" striped="false" style="--table-cell-padding: 10pt 12pt; --table-gap-x: 8pt; --table-gap-y: 8pt;"><tbody><tr><td background-color="#F4D7D4" valign="middle"><labels><label variant="solid">Changed</label></labels></td><td background-color="#F4D7D4"><h3>The conflict stopped</h3><p font-size="16pt">The ten-year conflict ended in 1845.</p></td></tr><tr><td background-color="#F4D7D4" valign="middle"><labels><label variant="outline">Did not change</label></labels></td><td background-color="#F4D7D4"><p font-size="16pt"><b>Brazil stayed together.</b> Rio Grande do Sul did not remain separate.</p><p font-size="16pt"><b>Slavery continued.</b> Abolition was not an outcome of the revolt.</p></td></tr></tbody></table><grid spacing="none" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item id="sgVxkyKnSJ" background-color="accent" padding="12pt 14pt"><grid spacing="small" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item id="eo3GNpdGJR" vertical-align="center" colspan="13"><h4>Big idea</h4></grid-item><grid-item id="-Nc5NRo6lk" vertical-align="center" colspan="47"><p font-size="16pt">Ending a conflict does not automatically make life fair for everyone.</p></grid-item></grid></grid-item></grid><p font-size="11pt">Source: <span text-color="#3A302A"><a href="https://cultura.rs.gov.br/upload/arquivos/carga20210405/27100547-anais-ahrs-v-16-1.pdf">Anais AHRS, vol. 16 (PDF)</a></span></p></grid-item></grid></section>